WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
The flat tool turns the plug at the entrance. The hook reaches through the front wafer’s window.

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.667
Watch the front spring. It compresses as the hook lifts the wafer.

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:02.625
The hook lowers and the wafer comes back down. Try the middle wafer next.

00:00:02.625 --> 00:00:03.333
The hook passes through the front window and lifts the upper edge of the middle one. This wafer resists.

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:04.333
The two white marks shift as the plug turns. The housing now supports the middle wafer, so the hook can move away.

00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:05.958
The first wafer now binds. This time the hook lifts it clear.

00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:08.125
The plug turns a little farther as the front wafer clears. Two wafers now stay up.

00:00:08.125 --> 00:00:10.458
The hook returns to the middle window. The middle wafer is still up.

00:00:10.458 --> 00:00:13.042
The last wafer clears. Watch the small advance just before the plug turns to open.

00:00:13.042 --> 00:00:13.833
All three wafers turn with the plug as the hook withdraws.
